width="500" height="16"><content textType="body" fontSize="9.5" color="rgb(217,150,46)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="Roboto Mono" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="1" bold="true"><p>统一输出</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="440" width="820" height="22"><content textType="body" fontSize="13" color="rgb(255,255,255)" textAlign="left" fontFamily="思源黑体" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" verticalAlign="top" letterSpacing="0" bold="true"><p>SARIF 标准报告：行号 · CWE · 证据链 · 修复建议，可直接接入 VS Code 与 CI 流水线</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="12"><p>八个自研组件串成一条完整流水线。前三个负责召回：TaintTracker 污点追踪、Prefilter 正则预筛、ExternalScanner 封装外部工具；CodeSlicer 切片后交给 LLM Judge 封闭裁决；之后 CWE Normalizer 归一编号、LineNormalizer 对齐行号、FixVerifier 验证修复。最终统一输出 SARIF 标准报告，IDE 和 CI 可以直接消费。</p></content></note></slide>